type: software
title: "ifc-agent-tools: an AI-agent-enabled BIM research platform (research prototype)"
abstract: >-
  MCP server and Claude Code skill that let AI agents read IFC models, run quantity
  take-off, clash detection and authored-quantity validation, and screen natural
  ventilation, with all numbers computed by deterministic, unit-tested tools.
